":"so protect him!"}],"ref":"23:88","answerWord":"يُجَارُ","answerSound":"audio/17b18054db1f1b8701f6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: In Whose hand is the dominion over all things and He protecteth, while against Him there is no protection, if ye have knowledge?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaštititi, pružiti utočište","en":"to protect, to grant refuge"},"passage":["قُلْ","مَنۢ","بِيَدِهِۦ","مَلَكُوتُ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","وَهُوَ","يُجِيرُ","وَلَا","يُجَارُ","عَلَيْهِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَجَارَ"}},{"id":"ajara-46-31-10","words":["verb:ajara"],"options":[{"bs":"i štiti vas","en":"and he/it protects you (all)"},{"bs":"biva zaštićen","en":"he/it is protected"},{"bs":"zaštititi me","en":"(will) protect me"},{"bs":"štiti","en":"he/it protects"}],"ref":"46:31","answerWord":"وَيُجِرْكُم","answerSound":"audio/86fad01691a6f2ee98d3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O our people! respond to Allah's summoner and believe in Him. He will forgive you some of your sins and guard you from a painful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaštititi, pružiti utočište","en":"to protect, to grant refuge"},"passage":["يَٰقَوْمَنَآ","أَجِيبُوا۟","دَاعِىَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَءَامِنُوا۟","بِهِۦ","يَغْفِرْ","لَكُم","مِّن","ذُنُوبِكُمْ","وَيُجِرْكُم","مِّنْ","عَذَابٍ","أَلِيمٍ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"أَجَارَ"}},{"id":"ajara-72-22-3","words":["verb:ajara"],"options":[{"bs":"zaštititi me","en":"(will) protect me"},{"bs":"i štiti vas","en":"and he/it protects you (all)"},{"bs":"štiti","en":"he/it protects"},{"bs":"biva zaštićen","en":"he/it is protected"}],"ref":"72:22","answerWord":"يُجِيرَنِى","answerSound":"audio/4d49c55720e479e5fa04.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Lo! none can protect me from Allah, nor can I find any refuge beside Him","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaštititi, pružiti utočište","en":"to protect, to grant refuge"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِنِّى","لَن","يُجِيرَنِى","مِنَ","ٱللَّهِ","أَحَدٌ","وَلَنْ","أَجِدَ","مِن","دُونِهِۦ","مُلْتَحَدًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَجَارَ"}}]